      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi mujiki wamumbanda, mwana kaBabiloni, suluka wushakami mulunkuŋu. Eyi mwana kawaKaladeya wamumbanda, shakamaheseki, hikudi itanda dawantaku, hiyakakutena nawa cheŋi nawu wukweti mujimba wawovu hela nawu wadishitulaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwata kumalola wuhaliwuŋa. Fumisha chitambala cheyi kunamutu, vúulaku chikwembi cheyi, butulula nyendu yeyi wuzambuki tuloŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iheŋu deyi akadibutulula, eŋa, wusonyi weyi akawumona. Nakatenda, hinaketŋa muntuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkúuliyetu ijina dindi diyi Yehova wamazaza, Wajila waIsarela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi mwana kawaKaladeya wamumbanda, shakamakuzo, iŋila mumwidima, muloŋa hiyakakutena nawa cheŋi nawu, Maaku wamatuŋaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nazuwili nawantu ami, najiloleli wuswana wami, hinukuyihana kudeyi. Eyi kweyi kuyimwekeshela wushona nehi, watwikili atushinakaji mpanda yeyi yasweja kulema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Welili neyi, Ami nakekala maaku hohu chahaya nyaka, dihu hafuminikubula kusha yumiyi kumuchima weyi, hela kwanuka kuyakakumina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyaku chumichi eyi wadiluŋishaŋa, washakamaŋa nakudiwujola, welaŋamumuchima weyi neyi, Ami, yami hohu, hikudi wacheŋuku. Neyi, Hinamba kashakama muwutuluwaku, hinamba kafwisha anyanamuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yumiyi muyiyedi yakakuwana mumpinji yoyimu hohu, mwifuku dimuhohu, nikufwisha anyana, niwutuluwa; yakakuwana muchashikila chikupuhela waswejela hodi kupanda, hela wavulishila hodi masaku eyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi wunadikaŋili mukubajama kweyi. Wuneli dehi neyi, kwosi wanimonaŋaku. Maaneyi niyuma yiweluka diyi yinakuluwaŋeshi. Wunahoshi dehi mumuchimaweyi, neyi, Ami, yami hohu, hikudi wacheŋuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi katamaka kakuwana, hiwakamona muwutweleluku; chuma chakala chakakushintakesha, hiwakamona muwulekesheluku; wakakasumuka wajilumuka dehi, nikuchiluka nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi wapandapanda nyiseŋu yeyi, wasweja masaku eyi lwakabakana dehi kufumisha kuwansi, imanaku nachu tutali neyi yikukukwashaku, tutali neyi wukwimika nachu mushindu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muwunakatali nakushakajala hampùŋa, akwakwambula mawulu, niakwakutala tutumbwa, nieluka yamukakweji mukakweji, anyamuki akwamwini kuyuma yikukeŋa kukuwana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyaku, wena akekala neyi ntotu, kesi kakayocha, hiyakatweshakudipulwisha kuŊovu yanyilaŋu yakesuku, hikesi kamakala akwotaku, hela kejiku dakushakamaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dimu muwakamona yuma yiwadi ijina kukabakana. Akwenu wadiŋi nakulandujola nawu kufumisha kuwansi, akapwapuka iwu nakwindi, iwu nakwindi, hikwakamwekana wakukwamwinaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
